  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CADEC Hwange Sustainable Livelihoods Programme - CAFOD monitoring</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;	To provide safe water and sanitation for targeted communities in the Diocese of Hwange.
&quot;	To establish nutrition gardens in specified communities in Lupane and Hwange Districts
&quot;	To provide care for the sick, and orphans and other vulnerable children, through improved water supply and increased nutrition
&quot;	To continue to develop a small diocesan level CADEC department to coordinate development work under the Zimbabwe Catholic Bishops Conference in the districts of Hwange and Lupane (north of Shabula River).
&quot;	To collaborate with Zimbabwe Catholic Bishops&apos; Conference (ZCBC) and other stakeholders on development issues of the diocese through the National CADEC office.</narrative>
  </description>
